### =============================================================================
### AUTHENTICATION TESTS - API Gateway (Port 4000)
### =============================================================================

### 1. Login as Admin (Get admin token first)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "adminpassword"
}

### 2. Login as Encadrant
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "encadrant@example.com",
  "password": "encadrant123"
}

### 3. Login as Student
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newstudent@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

## Login As Incube
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newincube@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}



### 4. Login with Invalid Credentials
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 5. Login with Missing Fields
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 6. Login As Encadrant
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newencadrant@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### =============================================================================
### USER REGISTRATION (Requires Admin/Encadrant Authentication)
### =============================================================================

### 6. Register New Student (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "email": "newstudent@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "nom": "Nouveau",
  "prenom": "Etudiant",
  "role": "Etudiant"
}

### 7. Register New Encadrant (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "email": "newencadrant@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "nom": "Nouveau",
  "prenom": "Encadrant",
  "role": "Encadrant"
}

### 8. Register New Admin (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "email": "newadmin@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "nom": "Nouveau",
  "prenom": "Admin",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### 9. Register New Incubé (Admin)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "email": "newincube@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "nom": "Nouveau",
  "prenom": "Incube",
  "role": "Incube"
}

### 10. Register with Invalid Role
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "email": "invalidrole@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "nom": "Invalid",
  "prenom": "Role",
  "role": "InvalidRole"
}

### 11. Register without Authentication (Should Fail)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "unauthorized@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "nom": "Unauthorized",
  "prenom": "User",
  "role": "Etudiant"
}

### 12. Register with Student Token (Should Fail - Permission Denied)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "email": "shouldfail@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "nom": "Should",
  "prenom": "Fail",
  "role": "Etudiant"
}

### =============================================================================
### TOKEN MANAGEMENT
### =============================================================================

### 13. Verify Token (Valid)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 14. Verify Token (Invalid)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### 15. Verify Token (Missing Authorization Header)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/verify-token

### 16. Refresh Token (Valid)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### 17. Refresh Token (Invalid)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "invalid_refresh_token_here"
}

### 18. Refresh Token (Missing Token)
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": ""
}

### =============================================================================
### USER MANAGEMENT
### =============================================================================

### 19. List Users (Admin)
GET http://localhost:4000/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 20. List Users (Encadrant)
GET http://localhost:4000/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{encadrant_token}}

### 21. List Users (Student - Should Fail)
GET http://localhost:4000/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 22. List Users (Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:4000/auth/users 